/Title (The Transplant & Uro-Genital Society, Sirsi, is delighted to welcome you to Sirsi, Karnataka, for the first time. KUACON 2027 brings together eminent faculty and urology professionals for insightful discussions, collaborative learning, and meaningful scientific exchange. We invite you to explore the natural beauty, rich culture, local cuisine, and warm hospitality of Sirsi. We encourage active participation in the workshops and scientific sessions, fostering knowledge sharing and professional growth. We are confident that KUACON 2027 in Sirsi will be a memorable experience and contribute significantly to the advancement of urological care and practice.  We look forward to welcoming you!)
